    "name": "Tactical Magnifier - Zoom Your Display",
    "steam_appid": 3356750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Magnifier is a helpful tool for games that feature long range shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It works by zooming in directly in the center of your display, enlarging every pixel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many customizable control options, including &quot;combo keys&quot; , &quot;zoom while holding&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a cheating software, as it only makes use of the built-in Windows Magnifier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Un-Noticeable performances, and invisible mode. It is a very light app</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Magnifier is for you if :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You often lean on your screen to get a better shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are visually impaired and cannot distinguish pixels on your display.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a high resolution display and want to take full advantage of it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are playing on a small display, or the display is far from your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Magnifier is a helpful tool for games that feature long range shooting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It works by zooming in directly in the center of your display, enlarging every pixel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many customizable control options, including &quot;combo keys&quot; , &quot;zoom while holding&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a cheating software, as it only makes use of the built-in Windows Magnifier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Un-Noticeable performances, and invisible mode. It is a very light app</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Magnifier is for you if :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You often lean on your screen to get a better shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are visually impaired and cannot distinguish pixels on your display.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a high resolution display and want to take full advantage of it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are playing on a small display, or the display is far from your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A tool that magnifies your display, made for tactical shooters with long engagement distances.",
